repository-code: "https://github.com/lancasterSano/pr-review-research"
license: MIT
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-21"
abstract: >-
  Collector of closed pull requests and their review history from public
  GitHub repositories (GraphQL API), with per-PR feature computation and a
  manifest of a 40-repository corpus, and the reviewer ranking experiments of
  the AAIT 2026 paper. Built for a PhD dissertation on the efficiency of the
  code review process.
keywords:
  - code review
  - pull requests
  - GitHub
  - mining software repositories
  - reviewer recommendation
